<section class="sec" id="sec-calc">
  <div class="sec-h"><span class="sec-n">06</span><h2>Live Determinacy Calculator</h2></div>
  <p>Pick a standard structure to load its counts, or enter your own. The calculator shows the arithmetic term by term, so you can see <em>where</em> a number came from rather than just the verdict.</p>

